testapp5/build/iphone/Classes/APSAnalytics/libAPSAnalytics.a(APSUtility.o):  warning: /var/folders/d5/xkn1gy8s6s70j_gch8wn6rwm0000gp/C/org.llvm.clang.kiat/ModuleCache/1DIW8GZF83F4R/CoreLocation-1XBA9X3WVO2SP.pcm: No such file or directory  while processing /Users/chris/appc/workspace/testapp5/build/iphone/Classes/APSAnalytics/libAPSAnalytics.a(APSUtility.o):  warning: /var/folders/d5/xkn1gy8s6s70j_gch8wn6rwm0000gp/C/org.llvm.clang.kiat/ModuleCache/1DIW8GZF83F4R/CoreLocation-1XBA9X3WVO2SP.pcm: No object file for requested architecture  while processing /Users/chris/appc/workspace/testapp5/build/iphone/Classes/APSAnalytics/libAPSAnalytics.a(APSUtility.o):  warning: /var/folders/d5/xkn1gy8s6s70j_gch8wn6rwm0000gp/C/org.llvm.clang.kiat/ModuleCache/1DIW8GZF83F4R/Darwin-1LVP8K6HYW6R.pcm: No such file or directory  while processing /Users/chris/appc/workspace/testapp5/build/iphone/Classes/APSAnalytics/libAPSAnalytics.a(APSUtility.o):  warning: /var/folders/d5/xkn1gy8s6s70j_gch8wn6rwm0000gp/C/org.llvm.clang.kiat/ModuleCache/1DIW8GZF83F4R/Darwin-1LVP8K6HYW6R.pcm: No object file for requested architecture  while processing /Users/chris/appc/workspace/testapp5/build/iphone/Classes/APSAnalytics/libAPSAnalytics.a(APSUtility.o):  warning: /var/folders/d5/xkn1gy8s6s70j_gch8wn6rwm0000gp/C/org.llvm.clang.kiat/ModuleCache/1DIW8GZF83F4R/UIKit-1MCEWB5GAZIR1.pcm: No such file or directory  while processing /Users/chris/appc/workspace/testapp5/build/iphone/Classes/APSAnalytics/libAPSAnalytics.a(APSUtility.o):  warning: /var/folders/d5/xkn1gy8s6s70j_gch8wn6rwm0000gp/C/org.llvm.clang.kiat/ModuleCache/1DIW8GZF83F4R/UIKit-1MCEWB5GAZIR1.pcm: No object file for requested architecture  while processing /Users/chris/appc/workspace/testapp5/build/iphone/Classes/APSAnalytics/libAPSAnalytics.a(APSUtility.o):  warning: /var/folders/d5/xkn1gy8s6s70j_gch8wn6rwm0000gp/C/org.llvm.clang.kiat/ModuleCache/1DIW8GZF83F4R/SystemConfiguration-6118N4HES0MC.pcm: No such file or directory  while processing /Users/